# ── Build artifacts ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
target/
*.pdb

# ── Dependencies ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Cargo.lock is committed for binary crates per Rust convention
# (ensures reproducible builds for published binaries).

# ── Rustfmt backups ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/*.rs.bk

